"preuve" = "proof";
"a poser" = "to place";
"carre de depart" = "starting box";
"places possibles" = "possible places";
"ligne" = "row";
"a retirer" = "to remove";
"pivot" = "pivot";
"ailes" = "wings";
"lien fort" = "strong link";
"bouts" = "ends";
"chaine" = "chain";
"zone observee" = "observed zone";
"Regarde l'unite marquee: elle est presque complete." = "Look at the marked unit: it is almost complete.";
"Dans cette ligne, colonne ou carre, tous les autres chiffres sont deja presents. Il ne reste qu'une case libre pour le chiffre manquant." = "In this row, column or box, all the other digits are already present. Only one free cell remains for the missing digit.";
"Regarde la case cible. Le hint ne cherche pas une position dans toute la grille: il lit seulement les notes de cette case." = "Look at the target cell. The hint is not searching the whole grid: it only reads this cell's notes.";
"Sa ligne, sa colonne et son carre bloquent les autres chiffres possibles." = "Its row, column and box block the other possible digits.";
"Quand il ne reste qu'une seule note dans une case, ce chiffre est force. Il n'y a pas de choix alternatif." = "When only one note remains in a cell, that digit is forced. There is no alternative choice.";
